n>: It is. I have been waiting for it for almost two years. I believe it might even surpass <span class=\"italic\">Avatar</span> as the highest grossing film of all time.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Well, if people continue to flock to this movie at this rate, I am sure this movie will beat <span class=\"italic\">Avatar</span> by next weekend.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I agree with you.  Oh no!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: What's wrong?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can't find my wallet. I must have left it on the coffee table at home.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: That's not good.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Listen, I've got a proposition for you. If you cover my movie and popcorn, I'll get you dinner tomorrow.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I don't know about that Peter. My credit card may be maxed out and I only have enough cash for my ticket and some popcorn.", "time": "24500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob03re2img04.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Let's try using your credit card. If it isn't too much to ask, there's nothing else we can do.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I don't think it will work Peter.  I tried it before and it was declined.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It has to work John! I have been waiting to watch this movie for years. If you won't do it, I'll take it upon myself to do it.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Relax Peter! It's not a big deal. If it's okay with you, there's always next time.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can't wait until next time. Please try! If you'll do it, I'll be forever grateful.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Okay, okay Peter calm down. I really hope this movie is worth all the hype!", "time": "48500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}